    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there isn't a next step. i'm not \"capable\" of building anything else. i'm just old and broken now. the math doesn't work anymore. i put everything i had into this, and i have zero to show for it. it's like i'm just a bad investment that's never going to break even.",
